<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Usuarios | LoginPro</title>
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/public/favicon-loginpro.svg" />
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    :root {
      --bg: #f4f5f7;
      --surface: #fff;
      --surface-2: #f8fafc;
      --border: #e1e4e8;
      --text: #1a1d23;
      --muted: #6b7280;
      --navy: #1e2d3d;
      --teal: #0d7a6b;
      --teal-soft: #f0fdfa;
    }
    body { margin: 0; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; background: var(--bg); color: var(--text); font-size: 14px; }
    .navbar { min-height: 52px; background: var(--navy); display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 18px; padding: 0 24px; }
    .navbar a { color: #cbd5e0; text-decoration: none; }
    .navbar .brand img { height: 28px; display: block; }
    .navbar .spacer { flex: 1; }
    .page { max-width: 1180px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 28px 20px 60px; display: grid; gap: 18px; }
    .page-header h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 22px; color: var(--navy); }
    .page-header p { margin: 6px 0 0; color: var(--muted); max-width: 850px; line-height: 1.5; }
    .card { background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 12px; padding: 18px; box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.06); }
    .card h2 { margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 16px; color: var(--navy); }
    .hint { color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.45; }
    .supervisor-users-list { display: grid; gap: 10px; margin-top: 14px; }
    .supervisor-user { border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; background: #fff; }
    .supervisor-user > summary { cursor: pointer; padding: 13px 14px; font-weight: 750; background: var(--surface-2); }
    .supervisor-user-body { padding: 14px; display: grid; gap: 12px; }
    .supervisor-module { border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 10px; padding: 10px; display: grid; gap: 8px; }
    .supervisor-module-title { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 9px; cursor: pointer; }
    .supervisor-module-title input { margin-top: 2px; width: 17px; height: 17px; accent-color: var(--teal); }
    .supervisor-module-title strong { display: block; color: var(--navy); }
    .supervisor-module-title small { display: block; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 2px; }
    .supervisor-module-functions { display: grid; gap: 6px; padding-left: 26px; }
    .supervisor-function { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 8px; padding: 6px 8px; border-radius: 7px; background: var(--teal-soft); }
    .supervisor-function input { margin-top: 2px; width: 16px; height: 16px; accent-color: var(--teal); }
    .supervisor-function span { display: grid; gap: 2px; }
    .supervisor-function small { color: var(--muted); }
    .supervisor-actions { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .btn { border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 8px; padding: 9px 13px; cursor: pointer; font-weight: 700; font-size: 13px; background: #fff; color: var(--text); }
    .btn-primary { background: var(--teal); border-color: var(--teal); color: #fff; }
    .btn:disabled { opacity: .55; cursor: not-allowed; }
    .status-success { color: #166534; }
    .status-error { color: #b91c1c; }
    .empty { padding: 22px 8px; text-align: center; color: var(--muted); }
    @media (max-width: 720px) {
      .page { padding: 18px 12px 40px; }
      .supervisor-module-functions { padding-left: 8px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <nav class="navbar">
    <a class="brand" href="/admin" aria-label="LoginPro"><img src="/public/logo-loginpro.svg" alt="LoginPro" /></a>
    <a href="/admin">Candidatos</a>
    <a href="/admin/operaciones">Operaciones / Despacho</a>
    <span class="spacer"></span>
    <form method="post" action="/logout"><button type="submit">Cerrar sesión</button></form>
  </nav>

  <main class="page">
    <div class="page-header">
      <h1>Usuarios</h1>
      <p>Administra los módulos y las funciones operativas de los usuarios a tu cargo. DEV conserva la asignación de roles y define qué funciones internas puedes delegar.</p>
    </div>

    <section class="card" data-supervisor-users-workspace="true">
      <h2>Permisos operativos del equipo</h2>
      <p class="hint">Puedes activar o desactivar los módulos que tú también tienes disponibles. Dentro de cada módulo solo aparecen las funciones que DEV autorizó para tu supervisión.</p>
      <div class="supervisor-users-list" data-supervisor-users-list="true"><div class="empty">Cargando usuarios…</div></div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <script src="/public/supervisor-user-access.js" defer></script>
</body>
</html>
